{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976310/extras/Designer__10_.png?t=1744322449\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHERE THE STORY UNFOLDS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After the end of the world, hardly anything was left - except the &quot;Concrete District&quot;, a surreal place of endless concrete facades, without doors, without windows - like a city that was never built for people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976310/extras/Designer__11_.png?t=1744322449\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>EVERY STATUE FOLLOWS THEIR OWN RULES. LEARN THEM - OR DIE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The district is haunted by eerie humanoid statues, each with its own bizarre and terrifying behavior. Some of these statues move only when you\u2019re not looking, others are always in motion, and some remain still until you make eye contact. You never know which ones will come to life and threaten you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976310/extras/cocnrete.gif?t=1744322449\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IT WILL GET WORSE AND WORSE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The tension builds as you explore, never sure if it\u2019s safe to look away. The atmosphere is oppressive, and the challenge is more psychological than physical. Will you survive the twisting corridors of the Concrete District, or will the statues claim you as their next victim?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976310/extras/Designer__12_.png?t=1744322449\" /></p>","backgrou